 -- \"I have ways of making money that you know nothing about\" -- Pipelines of another kind -- Worth means quay -- Jawn D.'s clear conscience -- Soulless, grasping corporation -- History is bunk -- Company built on trust -- New nation under God -- Napoleon as a businessman -- End of a dream -- \"We must feel our way along\" -- Hedgehog and the fox -- Net worth -- \"Poor Frank!\" -- Last coup -- \"That benighted woman\" -- \"The most hated man in the world\" -- Dissolution","note":[{"@type":"statement of responsibility","#text":"David Freeman Hawke."},{"@type":"bibliography","#text":"Includes bibliographical references and index."}],"subject":[{"geographicCode":{"@authority":"marcgac","#text":"n-us---"}},{"@authority":"lcsh","name":{"@type":"personal","namePart":["Rockefeller, John D. (John Davison)",{"@type":"date","#text":"1839-1937"}]}},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Businessmen","geographic":"United States","genre":"Biography"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Petroleum industry and trade","geographic":"United States"},{"@authority":"lcsh","topic":"Businesspeople","geographic":"United States","genre":"Biography"}],"classification":[{"@authority":"lcc","#text":"HD9570.R6 H38 1980"},{"@authority":"lcc","#text":"CT275.R75 H38"}],"relatedItem":[{"@type":"otherFormat","@otherType":"Online version:","@displayLabel":"Online version:","titleInfo":{"title":"John D"},"name":{"namePart":"Hawke, David Freeman."},"originInfo":{"publisher":"New York : Harper & Row, ©1980","edition":"1st ed."},"identifier":{"@type":"local","#text":"(OCoLC)654241342"}},{"@otherType":"HOLLIS record","location":{"url":"https://id.lib.harvard.edu/alma/990012884350203941/catalog"}}],"identifier":[{"@type":"isbn","#text":"006011813X :"},{"@type":"lccn","#text":"^^^79002733^"},{"@type":"oclc","#text":"5334129"}],"location":[{"physicalLocation":{"@displayLabel":"Harvard repository","@type":"repository","@valueURI":"http://isni.org/isni/0000000123374118","#text":"Baker Library, Harvard Business School, Har